      "en": "Picture the end of a long clinic morning. The dermatologist has a full waiting room, a stack of notes and ten minutes for you. You have a good product story. It is tempting to start with it right away.\n\nThe approved approach starts somewhere else. Before you say anything about Derolad, you acknowledge what hidradenitis suppurativa (HS) does to the people your customer treats every day. This lesson is about that first minute, why it matters and how to do it in a way that sounds like you and not like a script.",
